# Another World (WotG 28), the whole run. From East Ronfaure, the zone line into Southern San d'Oria plays the mission's
# zone-in 945 (the line's login answers it with option 0): its finish sets Prog 1. Warped into Chateau d'Oraguille,
# Halver at Prog 1 plays 566 [233, 23, 1756, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1]; its finish completes the mission (A Hawk in Repose current,
# Prog cleared).
lists SouthernSanDoria/onZoneIn/1 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/945 ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/566
char zone=EastRonfaure pos=86,-1,-40 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg AnotherWorld current
login
zoneline SouthernSanDoria                  # from East Ronfaure: 945, answered 0
warp 2,0.1,2 ChateauDoraguille
trigger Halver                             # Prog 1: 566
finish                                     # completed
